    "title": "First responders reflect on 9/11 at annual memorial in South Williamsport - NewsBreak",
    "text": "3 hours ago SOUTH WILLIAMSPORT, Pa. — A bell echoing through time, a reminder of those who lost their lives, a sound bringing some back to what they saw in the weeks after 9/11. Steve Ishler, a former White Deer Township EMS, says, \"It was October, I think it was the fifth week. They needed two teams to go to ground zero, primarily for Port Authority Police Department, that was basically our orders to go there.\" Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
